        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG104/204, Contemporary Stainless Steel Lever With Square Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe very crisp corners of which exude the clean lines of modern decor. The AHI made Stainless Steel Sapporo Lever with Square Rose features a concealed screw rose (no screws show) with self aligning spring assisted levers for a clean look. All the exterior components including the latch, screws, and strike plates are stainless steel. Strong, durable, beautiful it is easy to install and fits standard pre-drilled doors. Available in Satin (soft) or  Polished (bright) Stainless Steel finishes. This ADA compliant leverset will fit standard 2-1/8\" door cut outs. Available for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. Adjustable for door thicknesses from 1-3/8\" to 2\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-7506-specifications.gif?v=1704354718\" width=\"600\" height=\"248\" border=\"0\" atl=\"SIG104 Specifications for Stainless Steel Sapporo Lever with Square Rose\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-sapporo-leverset-ahi-sig104\"><b>AHI SIG104 With Round Rose</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Stainless Steel AHI SIG104/204 Sapporo Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For residential or commercial applications</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors)</li>\r\n<li>Field reversible tubular latch</li>\r\n<li>Premium latch requires only 28° rotation to retract latchbolt</li>\r\n<li>Meets standards of the <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the SIG104 Sapporo Stainless Steel Lever With Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-9/16\" (141 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lever Thickness: 7/8\" (22 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\" (64 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Spindle Width: 0.31\" (8 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" (64 mm) squared</li>\r\n<li>Rose Thickness: 3/8\" (10 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a door pull or to match trim. Trim is on one side of door. Lever is surface mounted (mounting plate screws to the doors face).</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. For use with a standard 2-1/8\" bore hole pre-drilled door. </li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Stainless Steel Sapporo Lever with Square Rose, AHI SIG104/204",
                "description": "AHI SIG104/204, Contemporary Stainless Steel Lever - The very crisp corners of which exude the clean lines of modern decor. The AHI made Stainless Steel Sapporo Lever with Square Rose features a concealed screw rose (no screws show) with self aligning spring assisted levers for a clean look. All the exterior components including the latch, screws, and strike plates are stainless steel. Strong, durable, beautiful it is easy to install and fits standard pre-drilled doors. Available in Satin (soft) or  Polished (bright) Stainless Steel finishes. It is ADA compliant; and will fit standard 2-1/8 inch door cut outs. Available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Adjustable for door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches.",
                "keywords": "AHI-SIG104/204, AHI SIG104/204, ada compliant levers, modern door levers, contemporary door levers, Contemporary Square Rose Door Levers, code compliant levers, ahi sigma line levers, Stainless Steel Sapporo Lever with Square Roses, Contemporary Square Rose Door Levers, Stainless Steel Sapporo Levers,"
